Package: sitepublish
Type: Package
Title: RStudio Addin to Build and Publish this Quarto Site
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jeremy", "Genette", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A tiny, single-project RStudio addin that renders the Quarto
    website and pushes it to GitHub with {gert}, via a small Shiny gadget
    that asks for a commit message. Not meant for CRAN -- install locally
    from the project with devtools::install("rstudio-addin", quick = TRUE).
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    gert,
    quarto,
    miniUI,
    shiny,
    rstudioapi
